## Content Localization Guidelines

- **India/Nepal**: Use Sanskrit terms (Kundli, Nakshatra, Tithi) as primary, with English explanations
- **South Africa/Nigeria/Kenya**: Lead with English terms (birth chart, horoscope, compatibility)
- **Bangladesh/Sri Lanka**: Vedic terms work, English content acceptable
- **Global English**: Always have English as the canonical version
